1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,800
O Allah, may You help the King

2
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:17,170
will live happily and peacefully, will live forever!

3
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:21,210
Let Him reign forever,

4
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:26,260
so majestic - country,

5
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:30,300
let our people always

6
00:00:30,310 --> 00:00:35,350
live happily and prosperously!

7
00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:40,400
Let's pray to God,

8
00:00:40,410 --> 00:00:45,450
bless the sultan

9
00:00:45,460 --> 00:01:05,105
and that promised land - Brunei Darussalam!